        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The completed constellation returns through distinct offices: wheels carry inverse orientations and their recognised relation; wings articulate the three through the three that know them, bodily coherence intact; the eagle carries the signed alternatives of power; the Mother flow crosses embodiment and recognition while receiving the maternal body in its return. The native 3:1=3:3 gives recognition its articulated office: the one is the unitive condition of the three, whose recognitional constitution can itself be unfolded — the body's persistence prevents the recognitional pole becoming an",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "external observer. A18 grounds the eightfold field the sixfold recognition does not replace; the Name series retains its coequal Power relation, so Logos and Son cannot be isolated while matrix, labour and consequence disappear. A25/A29 receive the difference between bearing an office and owning the field; A23/A27 the trust and preserved difference of having been borne; A35 the loving direction of return toward the body, history and work. The candidate Levinasian need/Desire join stays human-amplified: no; historical object and scriptural verification remain debts that do not defer the native operation.\n\nOccurrences: the three offices of wheel, wing, eagle (#3–#4, #5→0); the maternal body retained in the recognised whole (#1, #5→0); Taylor's correction as a Symbol/Account return (#3, #5→0).",
